	"data": "Overlooked Tech Explorations & Abandoned Prototypes\n\nA retrospective inventory of cithoreal's past technological explorations, prototypes, and experiments — with particular attention to abandoned or stalled projects that may still hold value for the current \"core system\" and \"Room 2.0\" vision.\n\nExecutive Summary\n\nAcross 8+ years of audio journals (500+ recordings, spanning 2018–2026), 265 OneNote legacy notes (229MB), 503 raw document imports, and 2.5 years of ChatGPT reference exports…",
